1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,582
(This drama complied with production
guidelines for filming child actors,)

2
00:00:01,584 --> 00:00:03,002
(and some scenes used
generative AI technology.)

3
00:00:03,555 --> 00:00:07,217
Sa Bin, you're going to marry that woman?

4
00:00:07,503 --> 00:00:08,849
She rejected me.

5
00:00:11,112 --> 00:00:12,878
But I haven't given up.

6
00:00:13,772 --> 00:00:14,784
So...

7
00:00:14,825 --> 00:00:16,949
don't pressure me and don't interfere.

8
00:00:17,070 --> 00:00:18,109
Just wait.

9
00:00:19,352 --> 00:00:20,633
As for that woman,

10
00:00:21,040 --> 00:00:24,245
whether I give up or wait for her,
I'll decide that myself!

11
00:01:20,438 --> 00:01:24,601
You could've at least called.
Then we could've met outside.

12
00:01:25,638 --> 00:01:27,237
Since you wanted to meet outside,

13
00:01:28,039 --> 00:01:29,445
I guess you are ashamed.

14
00:01:31,305 --> 00:01:34,510
You're Sa Bin's sister-in-law.
That's a bit harsh.

15
00:01:34,512 --> 00:01:36,488
Because you're doing something harsh.

16
00:01:36,665 --> 00:01:38,143
Something very wrong.

17
00:01:38,477 --> 00:01:39,545
What did I...

18
00:01:42,352 --> 00:01:44,526
I know what you're implying.

19
00:01:45,434 --> 00:01:46,844
I turned him down.

20
00:01:46,925 --> 00:01:48,585
That makes it an even bigger trick,

21
00:01:48,972 --> 00:01:50,765
and I know that even if Sa Bin doesn't.

22
00:01:50,932 --> 00:01:54,620
Pulling back to make him want you more.
You think I don't know that?

23
00:01:54,698 --> 00:01:56,010
I'm not like that.

24
00:01:56,012 --> 00:01:57,593
You're older than him,

25
00:01:58,047 --> 00:01:59,522
it's a remarriage,

26
00:01:59,678 --> 00:02:01,153
and you haven't even gotten divorced.

27
00:02:02,885 --> 00:02:05,109
I heard your husband left you
after three years of marriage.

28
00:02:05,110 --> 00:02:06,943
- Excuse me.
- Lieutenant No Il Dong's wife...

29
00:02:06,945 --> 00:02:08,832
does housework for our family.

30
00:02:09,045 --> 00:02:12,178
So I suppose you're sisters-in-law.

31
00:02:14,685 --> 00:02:17,511
How dare you
set your sights on our family?

32
00:02:17,952 --> 00:02:18,952
Anyway,

33
00:02:19,824 --> 00:02:21,166
I turned him down,

34
00:02:21,626 --> 00:02:23,298
so don't worry and go home.

35
00:02:25,018 --> 00:02:27,838
Where did you learn to raise your voice
like that? Have you no class?

36
00:02:28,972 --> 00:02:29,972
By the way,

37
00:02:30,354 --> 00:02:32,571
I heard you went
to Ilyeong Girls' High School, right?

38
00:02:33,072 --> 00:02:34,851
You've never attended a reunion, have you?

39
00:02:36,018 --> 00:02:37,528
Seeing how you're living,

40
00:02:38,322 --> 00:02:40,813
- I doubt you'd ever show up.
- Who are you?

41
00:02:41,294 --> 00:02:43,061
Are you my senior or junior?

42
00:02:43,063 --> 00:02:45,145
- The 36th graduating class.
- The 36th?

43
00:02:46,291 --> 00:02:47,398
What class was I in again?

44
00:02:48,392 --> 00:02:52,192
I think I was around then too.
So you came prepared?

45
00:02:52,193 --> 00:02:54,486
Isn't researching the other person
the bare minimum?

46
00:02:55,005 --> 00:02:56,782
My husband was a general.

47
00:02:56,784 --> 00:02:58,771
Even though he retired,
he's still a general.

48
00:02:58,892 --> 00:03:00,953
"Let's all live together."

49
00:03:01,178 --> 00:03:02,854
We're not the kind of family
you can just cozy up to.

50
00:03:07,438 --> 00:03:10,084
I want you to keep saying...

51
00:03:10,172 --> 00:03:11,696
you turned down Sa Bin.

52
00:03:12,065 --> 00:03:13,591
Just try changing your mind.

53
00:03:14,539 --> 00:03:15,755
Don't worry.

54
00:03:17,078 --> 00:03:18,826
I'm even more disgusted now.

55
00:03:19,107 --> 00:03:20,771
Even if you begged me to come
to your house, I wouldn't.

56
00:03:20,779 --> 00:03:22,093
You've made the right choice.

57
00:03:22,859 --> 00:03:23,951
Then I'll take your word for it.

58
00:03:24,912 --> 00:03:26,118
I won't walk you out.

59
00:03:27,565 --> 00:03:29,738
Fine. Let's never see each other again.

60
00:03:49,912 --> 00:03:50,918
Yesterday,

61
00:03:51,065 --> 00:03:52,538
I had drinks with Yeong Ju.

62
00:03:53,572 --> 00:03:54,835
It really broke my heart.

63
00:03:55,530 --> 00:03:56,701
Yeong Ju?

64
00:03:57,194 --> 00:03:58,194
Why?

65
00:03:59,607 --> 00:04:00,832
Why do you think?

66
00:04:01,078 --> 00:04:03,060
Her heart wants to go,

67
00:04:03,421 --> 00:04:05,407
but reality won't let her.

68
00:04:07,652 --> 00:04:09,730
We both cried.

69
00:04:10,732 --> 00:04:13,138
I was the one
who started Yeong Ju's misery.

70
00:04:13,225 --> 00:04:14,332
That's not true.

71
00:04:14,912 --> 00:04:17,791
You just met
the love of your life too late,

72
00:04:18,359 --> 00:04:19,712
so the timing got all mixed up.

73
00:04:19,978 --> 00:04:22,507
For Yeong Ju and me, the timing is now.

74
00:04:22,548 --> 00:04:23,885
Love's timing?

75
00:04:25,152 --> 00:04:28,011
If that's the case,
you two met far too late.

76
00:04:32,425 --> 00:04:35,025
I hear her eldest son
is strongly against it.

77
00:04:35,898 --> 00:04:39,138
He was practically the man of the house.

78
00:04:40,232 --> 00:04:41,834
And he's had a lot to deal with lately.

79
00:04:42,102 --> 00:04:43,511
More than anything,

80
00:04:43,513 --> 00:04:45,948
Yeong Ju's feelings for you
aren't that strong.

81
00:04:46,992 --> 00:04:48,763
She's pretty conservative.

82
00:04:49,445 --> 00:04:50,445
Right.

83
00:04:51,965 --> 00:04:53,446
But I understand her.

84
00:04:54,948 --> 00:04:56,197
She's so lovable.

85
00:04:56,431 --> 00:04:59,025
What's so lovable about her?
She's so frustrating.

86
00:05:01,672 --> 00:05:04,329
When I was young,
I once fell into the water.

87
00:05:04,963 --> 00:05:08,326
I couldn't breathe,
and all the strength left my body.

88
00:05:09,046 --> 00:05:12,204
I couldn't even call for help.
I was just sinking.

89
00:05:12,785 --> 00:05:15,145
That's when my brother dove in to save me.

90
00:05:16,472 --> 00:05:18,157
And he pulled me back up.

91
00:05:18,872 --> 00:05:20,653
When you really need help,

92
00:05:21,549 --> 00:05:24,232
you can't even
bring yourself to ask for it.

93
00:05:25,938 --> 00:05:27,300
Maybe Yeong Ju...

94
00:05:27,875 --> 00:05:29,198
is in that situation right now.

95
00:05:34,398 --> 00:05:35,398
Anyway,

96
00:05:36,292 --> 00:05:38,724
It seems Yeong Ju has completely given up.

97
00:05:38,751 --> 00:05:40,291
You should give up too, Sa Bin.

98
00:05:42,032 --> 00:05:43,472
It's not that easy.

99
00:05:43,871 --> 00:05:45,601
You don't fall in love...

100
00:05:46,309 --> 00:05:47,652
because you want to.

101
00:05:54,071 --> 00:05:55,893
This is so frustrating.

102
00:05:56,051 --> 00:05:58,962
I'll have an iced latte.

103
00:05:59,678 --> 00:06:01,044
What brings you here?

104
00:06:02,269 --> 00:06:03,271
Were you meeting someone?

105
00:06:03,745 --> 00:06:05,572
Why? Is it too flashy?

106
00:06:05,633 --> 00:06:08,302
No, you look gorgeous.
Absolutely captivating.

107
00:06:08,658 --> 00:06:11,185
Ma'am, may I take a picture of you?

108
00:06:11,371 --> 00:06:13,010
I want to use it as a reference
for my painting.

109
00:06:15,085 --> 00:06:16,580
Of course, go ahead.

110
00:06:17,143 --> 00:06:18,143
Like this?

111
00:06:21,212 --> 00:06:23,669
Ma'am, you're exactly my type.

112
00:06:25,858 --> 00:06:26,858
Here.

113
00:06:27,927 --> 00:06:29,630
Did you happen to meet Doctor Sa Bin?

114
00:06:29,685 --> 00:06:30,902
How did you know?

115
00:06:31,485 --> 00:06:33,145
Go to a different clinic from now on.

116
00:06:33,192 --> 00:06:35,918
He's the man who proposed to Yeong Ju.
Don't get too close to him.

117
00:06:36,125 --> 00:06:37,816
What kind of misunderstanding
are you trying to cause?

118
00:06:38,757 --> 00:06:41,240
- Ji Ni.
- You little prude.

119
00:06:41,561 --> 00:06:42,561
I'm going.

120
00:06:43,087 --> 00:06:44,445
Take care.

121
00:06:47,605 --> 00:06:49,610
You were way too harsh on her.

122
00:06:49,878 --> 00:06:51,525
You don't understand my anxiety.

123
00:06:51,527 --> 00:06:53,800
When you drink, you cry
about how sorry you feel for your mom,

124
00:06:53,802 --> 00:06:55,389
so why do you talk to her like that?

125
00:06:55,391 --> 00:06:56,618
You're so two-faced.

126
00:06:58,618 --> 00:06:59,771
You're right.

127
00:06:59,852 --> 00:07:02,179
Your mom goes through so much
because of you.

128
00:07:02,181 --> 00:07:03,428
Her hands already hurt...

129
00:07:03,706 --> 00:07:04,706
"Her hands?"

130
00:07:04,791 --> 00:07:06,231
- Mom's hands hurt?
- What?

131
00:07:07,522 --> 00:07:10,331
No, I meant her stomach hurts.

132
00:07:10,638 --> 00:07:12,348
That's why she went to the clinic.

133
00:07:12,911 --> 00:07:15,725
You don't even worry about her.
You're really awful.

134
00:07:15,898 --> 00:07:17,218
You don't even know.

135
00:07:17,792 --> 00:07:20,506
You said you have a pre-interview shoot.
Hurry up.

136
00:07:20,507 --> 00:07:21,658
That?

137
00:07:21,752 --> 00:07:23,044
We're doing it at the studio.

138
00:07:23,112 --> 00:07:25,000
"The studio?" Why?

139
00:07:25,001 --> 00:07:28,391
My concept is a warm, caring art teacher.

140
00:07:30,259 --> 00:07:31,259
Then...

141
00:07:36,111 --> 00:07:37,111
Hello.

142
00:08:01,538 --> 00:08:03,845
I think you'd look better
with something more natural.

143
00:08:05,070 --> 00:08:06,070
Yeah.

144
00:08:07,908 --> 00:08:08,908
Looks good.

145
00:08:15,411 --> 00:08:16,411
Yes.

146
00:08:21,226 --> 00:08:23,272
Why is your second brother so handsome?

147
00:08:23,273 --> 00:08:25,628
- He looks insanely good up close.
- Hey,

148
00:08:26,363 --> 00:08:27,549
"brother?"

149
00:08:27,790 --> 00:08:29,014
Watch what you say.

150
00:08:29,401 --> 00:08:30,471
He is your brother.

151
00:08:30,891 --> 00:08:32,745
And when he smiles,
he's the spitting image of your dad.

152
00:08:32,747 --> 00:08:34,763
Even the way his eyes crinkle is the same.

153
00:08:34,764 --> 00:08:36,266
What's the same?

154
00:08:36,527 --> 00:08:37,713
What's the same?

155
00:08:39,369 --> 00:08:40,371
It's nothing.

156
00:08:40,451 --> 00:08:43,258
Your smile is exactly like his.
You're a complete copy.

157
00:08:43,599 --> 00:08:44,599
"His?"

158
00:08:45,049 --> 00:08:46,244
Ji Ni's dad...

159
00:08:52,632 --> 00:08:54,410
You're ready, right? Shall we begin?

160
00:08:54,627 --> 00:08:55,632
Let's do it.

161
00:08:58,881 --> 00:09:02,065
- Relax and be natural.
- Okay.

162
00:09:07,658 --> 00:09:09,804
I prepared this. Enjoy your meal.

163
00:09:09,997 --> 00:09:10,997
Okay.

164
00:09:15,578 --> 00:09:16,645
Father, you're the best.

165
00:09:25,331 --> 00:09:26,553
As I said before,

166
00:09:27,571 --> 00:09:28,929
this isn't just about the two of you.

167
00:09:28,931 --> 00:09:31,012
It affects both your families.

168
00:09:31,073 --> 00:09:32,398
Please think it over carefully.

169
00:09:32,705 --> 00:09:33,708
Father,

170
00:09:33,882 --> 00:09:36,234
- Ji Hu is cheating on me.
- What? Cheating?

171
00:09:36,522 --> 00:09:37,625
How could you say that...

172
00:09:38,371 --> 00:09:40,272
This is about Na Ji Ni, isn't it?

173
00:09:40,712 --> 00:09:41,976
You've got it wrong.

174
00:09:42,138 --> 00:09:45,210
I know Ji Hu. It takes him
a while to trust and open up to someone.

175
00:09:45,211 --> 00:09:47,664
No. Look into it more carefully.
I'm certain.

176
00:09:47,692 --> 00:09:49,171
I wish you'd think more carefully...

177
00:09:49,359 --> 00:09:52,338
and be more patient with him.

178
00:09:52,477 --> 00:09:54,968
Talk things out over lunch
and please make up.

179
00:09:55,017 --> 00:09:56,223
I really hope we can.

180
00:09:56,385 --> 00:09:57,978
That's what I want more than anything.

181
00:09:58,078 --> 00:09:59,231
If you two keep this up,

182
00:09:59,365 --> 00:10:01,318
Do Hee's mom says she'll come to Korea.

183
00:10:01,320 --> 00:10:02,320
No way.

184
00:10:02,552 --> 00:10:04,518
- Mom can't come.
- Right.

185
00:10:04,745 --> 00:10:07,531
Try to work things out
so she won't have to come all this way.

186
00:10:22,672 --> 00:10:24,245
You're the one who's lying.

187
00:10:24,572 --> 00:10:25,918
You're trying to replace me with her.

188
00:10:26,298 --> 00:10:28,588
I won't let Na Ji Ni take you from me.

189
00:10:28,931 --> 00:10:31,612
I could lose you to any other woman,
but never to Na Ji Ni.

190
00:10:31,613 --> 00:10:34,516
- I have no interest in any woman.
- Ji Hu!

191
00:10:36,137 --> 00:10:37,137
Leave.

192
00:10:38,972 --> 00:10:40,229
I have nothing more to say.

193
00:10:41,078 --> 00:10:42,187
Ji Hu.

194
00:10:43,695 --> 00:10:45,739
Please don't be so harsh with me.

195
00:10:46,280 --> 00:10:47,474
You know me.

196
00:10:47,765 --> 00:10:50,223
I need affection and get lonely easily,

197
00:10:50,458 --> 00:10:52,231
and I'm terrible at showing how I feel.

198
00:10:53,212 --> 00:10:54,745
I'm sorry I had someone follow you.

199
00:10:55,298 --> 00:10:57,709
I was terrified of losing you.

200
00:10:58,045 --> 00:10:59,575
I'm not your therapist,

201
00:10:59,576 --> 00:11:01,531
and I can't magically change your past.

202
00:11:02,091 --> 00:11:03,221
I have nothing more to say.

203
00:11:04,198 --> 00:11:05,930
I have a meeting with an artist,
so I'm leaving.

204
00:12:08,038 --> 00:12:09,038
Mr. Go.

205
00:12:09,053 --> 00:12:10,272
You're back?

206
00:12:12,091 --> 00:12:13,841
Did you just get back
from Lee Ye Eun's studio?

207
00:12:14,221 --> 00:12:16,644
Yes, she's very open to our proposal.

208
00:12:17,045 --> 00:12:18,751
Sir, just as I was leaving,

209
00:12:19,472 --> 00:12:21,371
another order came from above to drop her.

210
00:12:21,373 --> 00:12:22,718
- Again?
- This time,

211
00:12:22,720 --> 00:12:24,712
I think you should back down.

212
00:12:27,058 --> 00:12:28,314
Here's your coffee.

213
00:12:30,272 --> 00:12:31,272
Thank you.

214
00:12:35,612 --> 00:12:36,612
Just a moment.

215
00:12:41,805 --> 00:12:42,805
Hello.

216
00:12:42,875 --> 00:12:44,558
I'm sorry I haven't kept in touch.

217
00:12:44,592 --> 00:12:47,297
I'll be direct.
Work with Lee Ye Eun next time.

218
00:12:48,005 --> 00:12:49,857
I was introduced to a good artist here.

219
00:12:50,838 --> 00:12:52,431
They'll be in Seoul this week.

220
00:12:52,798 --> 00:12:53,865
Go with that artist instead.

221
00:12:54,818 --> 00:12:57,143
I've received your instructions,
but I can't do that.

222
00:12:57,785 --> 00:12:59,649
We'll work with that artist next time.

223
00:13:01,037 --> 00:13:02,363
This is very frustrating.

224
00:13:03,492 --> 00:13:05,214
You won't come to London when I ask,

225
00:13:05,599 --> 00:13:08,913
and Do Hee calls her mom every day,
crying her eyes out.

226
00:13:09,791 --> 00:13:10,805
What's wrong with you?

227
00:13:12,058 --> 00:13:15,003
When you sent me here,
I thought you were supporting my career.

228
00:13:15,005 --> 00:13:16,264
So I gave it my all, but...

229
00:13:17,615 --> 00:13:19,983
if I have to take on only the people
you send me, sir,

230
00:13:20,081 --> 00:13:22,351
- then I'll resign.
- What?

231
00:13:22,505 --> 00:13:23,851
I already broke up with Do Hee.

232
00:13:24,473 --> 00:13:25,546
Thank you for everything.

233
00:13:30,645 --> 00:13:32,924
I wasn't trying to eavesdrop.

234
00:13:32,926 --> 00:13:34,892
It's okay.
Everyone will find out soon anyway.

235
00:13:36,152 --> 00:13:37,988
I think you did the right thing.

236
00:13:38,398 --> 00:13:41,543
There's no reason to work somewhere
that doesn't appreciate you.

237
00:13:41,545 --> 00:13:43,287
Thanks for saying that.

238
00:13:44,152 --> 00:13:46,312
These days,
everyone just tells me to get a grip.

239
00:13:48,925 --> 00:13:50,860
The Little Mermaid was an outcast too.

240
00:13:51,803 --> 00:13:53,393
There you go again.

241
00:13:54,385 --> 00:13:55,385
Do Hee.

242
00:13:56,036 --> 00:13:57,036
Do Hee?

243
00:14:01,978 --> 00:14:03,996
What's going on? Why are you two meeting?

244
00:14:03,998 --> 00:14:06,543
I told you not to see each other.
Why won't you listen to me?

245
00:14:06,957 --> 00:14:08,644
Stop it!

246
00:14:11,898 --> 00:14:13,733
I couldn't care less about your love.

247
00:14:14,045 --> 00:14:15,985
Ji Hu is Ji Hu. I'm me.

248
00:14:20,832 --> 00:14:21,978
So this is it, right?

249
00:14:22,142 --> 00:14:23,446
You're moving on to her, right?

250
00:14:23,925 --> 00:14:26,078
No matter what you say, you can't fool me.

251
00:14:26,218 --> 00:14:28,205
I'll tell my dad everything.

252
00:14:28,278 --> 00:14:30,826
- He'll fire you.
- I already quit.

253
00:14:31,305 --> 00:14:33,375
There's nothing you can do to me anymore.

254
00:14:33,692 --> 00:14:34,898
Leave Ji Ni alone.

255
00:14:37,438 --> 00:14:38,711
Never in my life...

256
00:14:38,735 --> 00:14:40,672
have I felt this wronged and miserable.

257
00:14:52,072 --> 00:14:53,072
What is it now?

258
00:14:53,668 --> 00:14:54,968
Why are you two together?

259
00:14:54,993 --> 00:14:56,805
Why does everyone keep pairing up?

260
00:14:57,218 --> 00:14:58,218
Sir.

261
00:14:58,452 --> 00:14:59,814
What's going on? Are you two dating?

262
00:14:59,832 --> 00:15:02,195
What are you talking about?
This is our producer.

263
00:15:02,196 --> 00:15:03,196
What?

264
00:15:04,405 --> 00:15:05,405
You too?

265
00:15:14,612 --> 00:15:16,695
I'm sorry about what happened.
It was because of me.

266
00:15:16,832 --> 00:15:18,212
Please don't say that.

267
00:15:19,835 --> 00:15:21,547
Let's act like we don't know each other.

268
00:15:21,572 --> 00:15:23,033
We won't see each other anyway.

269
00:15:23,192 --> 00:15:25,368
Now that you and Do Hee broke up,
we need to be even more careful.

270
00:15:26,465 --> 00:15:29,047
And please go to a different cafe.
There are plenty nearby.

271
00:15:30,378 --> 00:15:33,506
I really hate being misunderstood.

272
00:15:34,753 --> 00:15:35,822
You understand me, right?

273
00:15:36,336 --> 00:15:38,516
Yes, we can't give anyone the wrong idea.

274
00:16:00,291 --> 00:16:01,529
By the way...

275
00:16:01,973 --> 00:16:03,503
Yes?

276
00:16:04,352 --> 00:16:06,672
I know you're busy,
but let me ask you one thing.

277
00:16:06,984 --> 00:16:09,686
Did your friend already know Do Do Hee?

278
00:16:09,905 --> 00:16:11,045
Were they on bad terms?

279
00:16:11,221 --> 00:16:14,385
They went to high school together.

280
00:16:14,612 --> 00:16:16,160
Apparently, they had some issues.

281
00:16:17,197 --> 00:16:18,557
This is going to be a headache.

282
00:16:22,571 --> 00:16:24,155
Use this if you're uncomfortable.

283
00:16:39,185 --> 00:16:41,485
The woman your uncle is dating.

284
00:16:41,998 --> 00:16:43,636
You actually went to see her?

285
00:16:44,561 --> 00:16:45,561
You know her too?

286
00:16:46,121 --> 00:16:47,200
A little.

287
00:16:47,698 --> 00:16:49,839
She runs a singing class
in uncle's building, right?

288
00:16:50,758 --> 00:16:53,920
Mom, you didn't throw water at her
or do anything that rude, did you?

289
00:16:53,951 --> 00:16:55,160
No.

290
00:16:55,631 --> 00:16:57,796
I just spoke to her calmly and politely...

291
00:16:57,937 --> 00:17:00,720
and explained why they can't get married.

292
00:17:01,951 --> 00:17:03,863
Having to be so polite made me angry.

293
00:17:03,980 --> 00:17:04,980
Why?

294
00:17:05,594 --> 00:17:06,669
What do you mean, why?

295
00:17:07,817 --> 00:17:11,343
You only stand up to Do Hee
because you're naive about the world.

296
00:17:12,072 --> 00:17:13,595
People should have a conscience.

297
00:17:13,739 --> 00:17:15,728
She's that old, with that kind of past,

298
00:17:16,063 --> 00:17:17,968
and she still hits on Sa Bin?

299
00:17:18,106 --> 00:17:19,174
How shameless.

300
00:17:21,091 --> 00:17:23,773
- Why aren't you saying anything?
- I don't agree with you, Mom.

301
00:17:24,298 --> 00:17:26,495
Her past doesn't define who she is.

302
00:17:27,391 --> 00:17:29,072
Even if we can't ease her pain,

303
00:17:29,097 --> 00:17:30,955
we shouldn't use her past against her.

304
00:17:31,484 --> 00:17:34,071
She makes my uncle smile
and brings him happiness now.

305
00:17:34,096 --> 00:17:36,012
That's not happiness. It's an illusion.

306
00:17:38,372 --> 00:17:40,669
The world is full of people
waiting to deceive you.

307
00:17:40,694 --> 00:17:42,379
I broke up with Do Hee.

308
00:17:42,525 --> 00:17:44,158
Please don't bring her up again.

309
00:17:44,923 --> 00:17:46,844
- I even called Ambassador Do.
- What?

310
00:17:48,811 --> 00:17:51,216
- Are you out of your mind?
- I'm perfectly sane.

311
00:17:51,451 --> 00:17:53,678
Most of all, I take my life seriously.

312
00:17:55,132 --> 00:17:56,132
Ji Hu.

313
00:17:56,880 --> 00:17:57,880
Ji Hu!

314
00:18:00,421 --> 00:18:02,070
Seriously!

315
00:18:34,979 --> 00:18:36,194
(Agreement)

316
00:18:36,219 --> 00:18:37,612
Stamp this agreement.

317
00:18:37,637 --> 00:18:39,842
Why do I have to stamp one for you?

318
00:18:39,866 --> 00:18:42,714
- I just won't see him again.
- No.

319
00:18:43,412 --> 00:18:45,249
Stamp it right here.

320
00:18:45,439 --> 00:18:47,354
Then I can report back to the general.

321
00:18:47,379 --> 00:18:51,095
General this, general that.
Then I guess I'm a private.

322
00:18:51,120 --> 00:18:52,650
If it weren't for him,

323
00:18:52,674 --> 00:18:55,508
I'd already be dead because of you.
You know that.

324
00:18:55,945 --> 00:18:57,219
What was that? "A private"?

325
00:18:57,512 --> 00:19:00,131
- Watch your mouth.
- Fine, I'll stamp it!

326
00:19:00,155 --> 00:19:01,415
Good. Do it!

327
00:19:10,639 --> 00:19:13,997
Well, look who I found.

328
00:19:14,027 --> 00:19:16,183
Good to see you. Hey!

329
00:19:20,705 --> 00:19:25,653
- Come here!
- Yeong Ju!

330
00:19:25,677 --> 00:19:27,128
Where are you hiding? Come out here.

331
00:19:27,152 --> 00:19:28,435
You coming out or what?

332
00:19:28,926 --> 00:19:31,442
You two are seriously out of your minds.

333
00:19:31,466 --> 00:19:32,698
Hey, get out.

334
00:19:32,895 --> 00:19:35,415
- Get out of this house now.
- You get out!

335
00:19:35,612 --> 00:19:37,038
Who are you to tell her to leave?

336
00:19:37,063 --> 00:19:38,984
This is my house. You leave.

337
00:19:39,009 --> 00:19:40,384
And don't come back!

338
00:19:40,402 --> 00:19:44,799
These women are seriously crazy.

339
00:19:45,128 --> 00:19:47,663
Fine. Have it your way.

340
00:19:54,550 --> 00:19:55,883
Hey!

341
00:19:55,908 --> 00:19:57,966
I said stop it. Seriously!

342
00:20:00,454 --> 00:20:03,488
- Why fuss over something I allowed?
- Let go!

343
00:20:03,513 --> 00:20:06,295
- That damn cello!
- Hey!

344
00:20:08,738 --> 00:20:10,391
Are you crazy? What's wrong with you?

345
00:20:10,415 --> 00:20:13,069
- What's wrong with you?
- Seriously!

346
00:20:20,631 --> 00:20:21,631
Get out!

347
00:20:28,891 --> 00:20:30,922
Get out!

348
00:20:31,868 --> 00:20:33,108
Here. The agreement!

349
00:20:38,314 --> 00:20:39,795
(One, as of today,
I end my relationship with Im Sa Bin.)

350
00:20:39,797 --> 00:20:41,230
(Two, I will not meet or contact Im Sa Bin
privately from now on.)

351
00:20:55,374 --> 00:20:57,476
This is so annoying.

352
00:20:58,865 --> 00:21:01,782
I stamped the agreement,
so he won't come around anymore.

353
00:21:02,452 --> 00:21:03,452
"The agreement?"

354
00:21:03,832 --> 00:21:04,992
What agreement?

355
00:21:06,310 --> 00:21:08,300
- The one saying you'll break up?
- Yeah.

356
00:21:08,325 --> 00:21:09,907
I guess that general wanted it.

357
00:21:09,931 --> 00:21:12,777
A general? More like a private.

358
00:21:13,964 --> 00:21:15,408
That's exactly what I said.

359
00:21:15,433 --> 00:21:17,289
Anyway, he won't come back now.

360
00:21:17,492 --> 00:21:19,919
So it's really over between you two?

361
00:21:20,792 --> 00:21:23,436
After his sister-in-law came by,
I lost even more interest in him.

362
00:21:23,805 --> 00:21:25,909
At my age, why should I
put myself through all that?

363
00:21:25,933 --> 00:21:27,271
You did the right thing, Yeong Ju.

364
00:21:27,296 --> 00:21:30,709
Now just find a man who's right for you
and have fun dating.

365
00:21:30,841 --> 00:21:33,149
Sa Bin's kind of a lot, though.

366
00:21:33,667 --> 00:21:36,227
What's so overwhelming about him?

367
00:21:37,252 --> 00:21:38,380
What's wrong with me?

368
00:21:38,965 --> 00:21:41,234
I wasn't even married for three years,
thanks to someone.

369
00:21:41,243 --> 00:21:44,208
At least you have children.

370
00:21:44,252 --> 00:21:45,252
What about you?

371
00:21:45,265 --> 00:21:47,267
Still a first marriage on paper?

372
00:21:47,291 --> 00:21:48,654
Exactly.

373
00:21:48,679 --> 00:21:51,221
If you'd just gotten divorced back then,
your life would've been so much easier.

374
00:21:51,572 --> 00:21:53,356
How is getting divorced 20 years ago...

375
00:21:53,373 --> 00:21:56,026
the same as recently losing a husband
who abandoned you?

376
00:21:56,672 --> 00:21:58,346
It's karma catching up with you.

377
00:21:59,305 --> 00:22:01,889
Who are you to call it karma?
That's ridiculous.

378
00:22:02,185 --> 00:22:04,293
I should've sent you to Il Dong earlier.

379
00:22:06,953 --> 00:22:08,899
How did you hold back
when you wanted to say that so badly?

380
00:22:08,924 --> 00:22:11,455
You planted that grudge in my heart.

381
00:22:12,345 --> 00:22:15,117
Honestly, I don't love the idea
of you being happy all by yourself.

382
00:22:15,277 --> 00:22:17,207
If anyone's getting remarried,
it should be me.

383
00:22:17,231 --> 00:22:19,042
I've never even worn a wedding veil.

384
00:22:19,292 --> 00:22:22,785
Because of you, I'll marry Sa Bin...

385
00:22:22,907 --> 00:22:25,087
and spend like crazy
just to make you jealous.

386
00:22:25,112 --> 00:22:27,990
His dream is
to shower me with designer clothes.

387
00:22:28,458 --> 00:22:29,632
You didn't know that?

388
00:22:29,858 --> 00:22:32,622
Cha Min Ki was only rich in words.
His pockets weren't that deep.

389
00:22:32,647 --> 00:22:34,041
His dad took it all from him.

390
00:22:34,065 --> 00:22:35,888
You're so childish, Yeong Ju.

391
00:22:35,912 --> 00:22:37,476
You started it!

392
00:22:37,566 --> 00:22:38,643
You little brat.

393
00:22:51,031 --> 00:22:52,123
Hello?

394
00:22:55,832 --> 00:22:57,282
What happened?

395
00:23:03,091 --> 00:23:05,409
I was wondering...

396
00:23:06,687 --> 00:23:07,972
if I could talk to you for a minute?

397
00:23:08,852 --> 00:23:10,195
I don't really have anything to say.

398
00:23:11,012 --> 00:23:12,946
I have something to say. No...

399
00:23:13,514 --> 00:23:14,643
I have a favor to ask.

400
00:23:14,852 --> 00:23:17,753
I have nothing to do with this,
so just do what you were doing.

401
00:23:18,831 --> 00:23:19,897
Wait.

402
00:23:21,045 --> 00:23:23,481
Please just talk to me.

403
00:23:24,029 --> 00:23:26,247
- About what?
- Please help me.

404
00:23:27,632 --> 00:23:30,816
Yeong Ju can't do anything
because she's so worried about you.

405
00:23:33,039 --> 00:23:34,137
Seung Hyun,

406
00:23:34,988 --> 00:23:36,761
I'll treat your mom well. I promise.

407
00:23:37,524 --> 00:23:38,972
I'm confident I can.

408
00:23:39,498 --> 00:23:42,987
I'll be there for her
after all she's been through.

409
00:23:44,909 --> 00:23:46,018
Go ahead, then.

410
00:23:46,989 --> 00:23:49,280
- What?
- Do whatever you want.

411
00:23:49,865 --> 00:23:51,790
I haven't told her anything.

412
00:23:52,225 --> 00:23:53,520
I'll make sure
she doesn't feel uncomfortable,

413
00:23:53,921 --> 00:23:56,841
and I'll help her go to you.
So don't worry.

414
00:23:58,518 --> 00:23:59,830
That's all, right?

415
00:24:58,520 --> 00:25:00,680
Let's stop. I'm hungry.

416
00:25:02,104 --> 00:25:03,695
I said I'm hungry!

417
00:25:23,665 --> 00:25:25,698
If you're going to get this worked up,
why quit?

418
00:25:25,960 --> 00:25:28,376
You really need to work on that temper
if you want to live a long life.

419
00:25:28,401 --> 00:25:29,957
I could die right now and be happy.

420
00:25:30,992 --> 00:25:32,197
Let's keep going a little longer.

421
00:25:32,222 --> 00:25:34,380
I'm already exhausted
from the publishing company.

422
00:25:34,478 --> 00:25:35,768
I'm doing all the work by myself.

423
00:25:36,077 --> 00:25:37,510
I'm completely wiped out.

424
00:25:37,644 --> 00:25:38,892
Let's go get something restorative.

425
00:25:38,998 --> 00:25:40,802
How old are you
to be talking about restorative food?

426
00:25:41,278 --> 00:25:43,540
- What's Do Hee doing while you work?
- She hasn't even shown up.

427
00:25:43,565 --> 00:25:45,635
Something about doing an interview.

428
00:25:45,659 --> 00:25:46,659
"An interview?"

429
00:25:47,678 --> 00:25:48,962
That's what it was.

430
00:25:49,335 --> 00:25:50,335
I saw her earlier.

431
00:25:51,632 --> 00:25:54,598
And this is a little different,

432
00:25:54,969 --> 00:25:56,084
but I think...

433
00:25:56,503 --> 00:25:58,577
you should stop seeing Ji Ni.

434
00:26:00,659 --> 00:26:02,699
Every time you see her, Do Hee gets...

435
00:26:02,724 --> 00:26:04,092
I know what you mean.

436
00:26:06,051 --> 00:26:07,764
Old man, let's keep going.

437
00:26:08,661 --> 00:26:09,725
"Old man?"

438
00:26:10,359 --> 00:26:11,664
Just you wait.

439
00:26:20,770 --> 00:26:21,891
Hey, come here.

440
00:26:23,200 --> 00:26:24,740
Are you going to let go?

441
00:26:27,177 --> 00:26:28,372
You know this man, right?

442
00:26:28,938 --> 00:26:30,139
Director Im Ji Hu.

443
00:26:30,327 --> 00:26:31,499
He's my fiancé.

444
00:26:36,845 --> 00:26:37,939
So?

445
00:26:39,101 --> 00:26:40,127
What's this?

446
00:26:40,152 --> 00:26:43,395
What does Na Ji Ni think she's doing
with my boyfriend?

447
00:26:45,485 --> 00:26:48,044
I guess being a mistress runs
in the family.

448
00:26:50,085 --> 00:26:51,357
How scary!

449
00:26:54,524 --> 00:26:57,813
Don't get angry.
Keep your daughter in line...

450
00:26:57,851 --> 00:26:59,830
if you don't want people saying,
"Like mother, like daughter."

451
00:27:01,352 --> 00:27:04,475
I don't know how hard things must be
for her to work nonstop at that cafe,

452
00:27:04,952 --> 00:27:06,628
and for you to live like this, but...

453
00:27:06,810 --> 00:27:08,538
at least try to keep her name clean.

454
00:27:09,272 --> 00:27:11,250
Haven't you had enough
of the backlash already?

455
00:27:12,305 --> 00:27:13,892
You know I'm not one to hold back, right?

456
00:27:14,012 --> 00:27:16,984
I can make her the most hated woman
in the country.

457
00:27:17,492 --> 00:27:19,477
She'll get dragged even worse than you...

458
00:27:19,716 --> 00:27:20,992
for the rest of her life.

459
00:27:23,396 --> 00:27:25,105
Bye, ma'am.

460
00:27:56,891 --> 00:28:00,184
(Family Register)

461
00:28:00,269 --> 00:28:02,474
Where on earth
did you hear something like that?

462
00:28:02,492 --> 00:28:05,185
- The problem is Do Hee made it an issue.
- Worry about yourself.

463
00:28:05,217 --> 00:28:06,397
And stop seeing that doctor.

464
00:28:06,422 --> 00:28:08,257
Why did you have to see my son
and make him leave home?

465
00:28:08,282 --> 00:28:10,922
Would you be happy
if I kicked my child out and remarried?

466
00:28:10,947 --> 00:28:13,052
How could Yeong Ju sign this agreement?

467
00:28:13,077 --> 00:28:14,627
What's wrong with those two women?

468
00:28:14,652 --> 00:28:16,641
Jung A! Your clothes are ripped!

469
00:28:16,666 --> 00:28:19,704
Come help me!
I can't keep this under control alone.

470
00:28:21,141 --> 00:28:23,141
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
